  unitName: Light Totem
  unitId: 50123
  unitNumber: 193
  description: Created by the gods, it embodies light's power. Legend is that those
    whom the great gods deem worthy can gain their power. Its huge wings sparkle
    in seven colors, and it's said to be an omen as it appears during auroras. The
    Light Totem is the gods' executor, not handing down judgments itself, but instead
    appearing after a decision has already been made.
  summonDesc: I am a Light Totem.<br>You would be wise to use my<br>godly powers
    responsibly.
